    "    \"## 5. Compute RGB Chromatic Coordinates\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Compute the normalized chromatic coordinates ($r_{cc}$, $g_{cc}$, $b_{cc}$) for each pixel in the time series.\"\n",
